# Patch: buyer-supplied operation_id on reporting-webhook
# Reason: scheduled media-buy delivery webhooks use McpWebhookPayload, whose
#   operation_id is required and must be copied from buyer registration.
# Filed: SDK issue #1092
# Upstream status: filed; not present in AdCP 3.2.0-beta.9.
# Drop when: the pinned AdCP bundle includes the same required correlation field.

